Landscape gameplay is clipped at the bottom: action buttons cut off, message not visible, scrollbar. Need a compact landscape layout.

Also sound icon looks muted (slash) here despite pressed; maybe the waves render as slash? The icon at top right clearly shows a speaker with a diagonal slash. Wait we toggled mute with 'm' earlier and reload should reset from localStorage soundOn=false (we toggled it). Yes! We pressed m, which saved soundOn false; so the icon is correctly muted. Mystery solved. The outer ring is just the button border; fine.

Landscape fix:
```
@media (max-height:520px) and (orientation:landscape){
  .app{padding-top:8px;padding-bottom:8px}
  .hud{gap:8px}
  .stage{gap:6px;padding:2px 0}
  .zone-line{max-width:100%;min-height:14px}
  .zone-label{font-size:8px}
